      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef prefix_sums(values):\n    prefix = [0]\n    for x in values:\n        prefix.append(prefix[-1] + x)\n    return prefix\n\n\nprint(prefix_sums([3, 1, 4, 1, 5]))\nprint(prefix_sums([]))\n```"
